  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758562,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## James Bond 007: Everything or Nothing (GameCube) - Synopsis\n\nStep into the world of espionage as James Bond 007 in *Everything or Nothing*, a thrilling action-adventure game for the GameCube! Continuing the narrative from *Die Another Day*, Bond finds himself embroiled in a dangerous plot involving nanotechnology and terrorism. Featuring Pierce Brosnan reprising his iconic role alongside familiar faces like Judi Dench (M) and John Cleese (Q), alongside Willem Dafoe as the menacing Nikolai Diavolo, the game delivers a cinematic experience.\n\nExperience a blend of intense third-person shooting, hand-to-hand combat, and exhilarating vehicle sequences, including high-speed chases in the Aston Martin Vanquish and Porsche Cayenne Turbo. Utilize Bond’s signature gadgets like the rappel gun and laser watch to overcome obstacles and outsmart your enemies. A unique cooperative multiplayer mode allows two players to tackle missions together. Developed by EA Redwood Shores, *Everything or Nothing* delivers a fresh perspective on the Bond franchise, bringing a dynamic and immersive gameplay experience to the GameCube.  A Game Boy Advance link cable can unlock exclusive content."
    },
